1
00:01:30,400 --> 00:01:34,400
Ma Ruyi, take off your clothes!

2
00:01:35,800 --> 00:01:37,600
Help!

3
00:01:38,800 --> 00:01:40,800
Where are you taking me?

4
00:01:42,800 --> 00:01:44,800
Do you hear someone crying for help?

5
00:01:45,800 --> 00:01:47,800
It's Ruyi!
Ruyi, are you all right?

6
00:01:48,600 --> 00:01:49,600
Move it!

7
00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:52,800
Ruyi!

8
00:02:05,800 --> 00:02:07,800
Ruyi, I'm coming!

9
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:21,400
Ruyi, I've come to your rescue!

10
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:25,800
You're the one beating him?

11
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:28,800
Help!
No...!

12
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:33,800
Are you all right?
Stop beating him. You'll kill him!

13
00:02:34,600 --> 00:02:39,800
Knowing I'm under the Obedience Spell,
he actually told me to strip!

14
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:41,800
Why didn't you do it then?

15
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:45,800
You're utterly shameless
and despicable!

16
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:47,800
Are you done?
It's my turn to beat him!

17
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:54,400
Stop it!
You'll kill him!

18
00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:56,800
Let's go!

19
00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:00,800
Men...!

20
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:11,800
I can't go on anymore

21
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:16,400
But you were so valiant just now

22
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:23,800
You're right. I was never so strong
and I never had so much energy

23
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:26,600
But it's all gone now

24
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:33,600
I've got it! It's the Deity of Medicine.
He enhanced your constitution

25
00:03:33,800 --> 00:03:39,400
I don't think it had anything to do
with him. You were the reason

26
00:03:39,800 --> 00:03:44,400
I was worried about you. That gave me
the strength to defeat them

27
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:48,400
I guess this is the... poweroflove

28
00:03:48,800 --> 00:03:52,400
-What did you say?
-The poweroflove

29
00:03:52,800 --> 00:03:55,800
Say it clearly!

30
00:03:56,800 --> 00:04:01,400
Don't be so fierce.
I'll be too scared to say anything

31
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:06,800
Can you smile and be more gentle? I'll
be able to say it more naturally then

32
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:18,800
That's right!
I like that smile!

33
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:20,800
Can you say it now?

34
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:25,600
All right

35
00:04:26,800 --> 00:04:30,800
I could take so many people on
because of ...

36
00:04:38,800 --> 00:04:41,400
the power of love

37
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:57,800
Why is my heart thumping so fast
and I get hiccups? Don't tell me...

38
00:04:57,800 --> 00:05:00,800
Don't tell me
this is the power of love?

39
00:05:01,800 --> 00:05:04,400
Ruyi, are you all right?

40
00:05:11,400 --> 00:05:15,400
I can hear your heart throbbing

41
00:05:18,800 --> 00:05:20,800
Get away from me

42
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:25,800
Ruyi!

43
00:05:36,800 --> 00:05:39,600
You're generous, I must say

44
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:42,600
Don't stand on ceremony.
We're good neighbours

45
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:46,800
May I wish you a life as long as the sun
and moon, and mountains and seas

46
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:53,400
Our culture is different from yours.
So I don't quite understand what you said

47
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:59,800
May you live as long as the sun and
the moon, and mountains and seas

48
00:06:00,800 --> 00:06:02,800
Well said!

49
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:05,800
Let me toast everyone!

50
00:06:05,800 --> 00:06:07,800
Drink to your fill, Your Highness

51
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:11,800
Down here, men and women are equal
when it comes to drinking

52
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:15,400
Great!

53
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:18,800
We'll toast Your Highness too!

54
00:06:18,800 --> 00:06:23,400
It's rare to have your presence here.
You must drink till you're drunk!

55
00:06:24,800 --> 00:06:26,800
I'm not a good drinker.
You go ahead

56
00:06:27,400 --> 00:06:31,400
But you just drank up a bowl

57
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:34,600
If you don't drink,
it'll mean you look down on us

58
00:06:34,600 --> 00:06:36,600
I don't mean that at all

59
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:38,800
Let me drink on Her Highness' behalf

60
00:06:38,800 --> 00:06:42,800
I don't see why you should do that.
Please drink, Your Highness

61
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:46,600
Otherwise, you'll make us lose face

62
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:58,800
Let me offer you another toast. May we
live in harmony for many generations

63
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:06,800
Drinking just one bowl for
our good relations is not enough

64
00:07:07,800 --> 00:07:10,400
This is to you!

65
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:28,400
May you enjoy longevity,
Your Majesty!

66
00:07:28,400 --> 00:07:31,800
I didn't know there were good drinkers
on the Central Plains too

67
00:07:32,800 --> 00:07:37,600
I thought you were a scholar who only
knew about poetry and sitting exams!

68
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:43,800
We're a big country with many talents

69
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:48,800
I must see how good you are then.
Do you dare have a duel with us?

70
00:07:55,800 --> 00:08:00,800
It's just to exchange pointers.
Why not?

71
00:08:02,600 --> 00:08:05,600
Great!
No harm exchanging pointers

72
00:08:05,800 --> 00:08:07,800
Forget it, Xiaotian

73
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:12,800
His Majesty sent me here. How can I
let him down by being a coward?

74
00:08:12,800 --> 00:08:16,800
Even if it's an unfair duel,
I must still take them on

75
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:19,800
Don't worry

76
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:20,800
Pardon me!

77
00:08:32,400 --> 00:08:33,400
Good wine!

78
00:08:54,800 --> 00:08:56,800
-Are you all right?
-Yes

79
00:08:58,800 --> 00:09:01,800
-Thanks for giving in to me
-I take my hat off to you!

80
00:09:03,800 --> 00:09:09,400
You're indeed an exponent of
martial arts. Sorry about just now

81
00:09:09,800 --> 00:09:13,400
-Here's a toast to you!
-Thanks!

82
00:09:24,400 --> 00:09:26,400
The results are out!

83
00:09:27,600 --> 00:09:30,600
Aren't you going to see the results?

84
00:09:31,800 --> 00:09:32,800
Let's go!

85
00:09:34,800 --> 00:09:37,800
There's no hurry.
Sit down

86
00:09:38,800 --> 00:09:42,600
If it's meant to be yours,
nobody can take it away from you

87
00:09:42,800 --> 00:09:43,800
True

88
00:09:43,800 --> 00:09:46,800
-You sound quite confident
-But of course

89
00:09:46,800 --> 00:09:51,400
If it's meant to come,
it will come

90
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:52,800
Right...

91
00:09:53,800 --> 00:09:57,800
Just like this chopstick.
It appears at mealtime

92
00:09:57,800 --> 00:10:01,400
When it's not mealtime,
it'd disappear!

93
00:10:01,400 --> 00:10:03,400
Right!

94
00:10:03,400 --> 00:10:05,400
Agreed, gentlemen?

95
00:10:07,800 --> 00:10:10,400
Please enjoy your meal

96
00:10:10,800 --> 00:10:14,400
-Give me another chopstick
-One moment, please

97
00:10:16,400 --> 00:10:18,400
Master Li, you came in third
in the exam!

98
00:10:18,800 --> 00:10:22,800
I'm third!

99
00:10:27,800 --> 00:10:31,400
-I'm third!
-Congratulations

100
00:10:31,800 --> 00:10:34,800
-I made a wasted trip again
-We didn't make it again

101
00:10:37,800 --> 00:10:39,800
Another wasted trip

102
00:10:40,800 --> 00:10:45,800
Cool down...

103
00:10:46,800 --> 00:10:52,800
Cool down, sir. It's just
the third position in the exam

104
00:10:52,800 --> 00:10:58,800
Yet he's elated.
Do you know what we call that?

105
00:10:58,800 --> 00:11:01,400
-He got carried away
-That's right

106
00:11:01,800 --> 00:11:03,800
Master Wei has got in!

107
00:11:03,800 --> 00:11:04,800
I have?

108
00:11:05,400 --> 00:11:08,400
Master Wei is second in the exam!

109
00:11:09,800 --> 00:11:13,400
Second? I'm second?

110
00:11:15,400 --> 00:11:18,400
It's impossible.
Is it me?

111
00:11:18,800 --> 00:11:20,800
Congratulations, Master Wei Guiyang!

112
00:11:20,800 --> 00:11:23,400
Let's go home to tell everyone!

113
00:11:24,400 --> 00:11:28,400
Two people have got the third and second
positions. And the first position...

114
00:11:28,800 --> 00:11:32,800
-We've studied for nothing!
-We've wasted our time!

115
00:11:33,800 --> 00:11:39,800
Just cool down...

116
00:11:42,800 --> 00:11:49,400
Go home and study for a few more years
and you'll make it next time

117
00:11:49,800 --> 00:11:50,800
Why?

118
00:11:50,800 --> 00:11:53,800
Because I won't be here next time

119
00:12:13,600 --> 00:12:15,600
The results are out!

120
00:12:23,800 --> 00:12:25,800
You haven't paid!

121
00:12:25,800 --> 00:12:28,800
Why didn't you get them
to pay first, you fool?

122
00:12:29,800 --> 00:12:35,800
Let them be.
I'll settle the bills for everyone

123
00:12:36,800 --> 00:12:38,800
Thank you, sir!

124
00:12:38,800 --> 00:12:42,400
-Call me Top Scholar
-Thank you, Top Scholar!

125
00:12:43,800 --> 00:12:45,400
Enjoy yourself

126
00:12:46,400 --> 00:12:49,400
Don't worry, they'll come back

127
00:13:50,800 --> 00:13:51,800
Great!

128
00:13:58,800 --> 00:14:00,800
Here's to you, Your Highness

129
00:14:06,800 --> 00:14:10,400
I was really worried when you
duelled with the three commanders

130
00:14:12,800 --> 00:14:17,400
The king isn't to be trifled with.
All his men are no mediocrities

131
00:14:17,800 --> 00:14:19,800
It was by luck I beat them

132
00:14:21,800 --> 00:14:23,800
You're injured!

133
00:14:25,800 --> 00:14:28,800
I'll be all right after some rest

134
00:14:29,800 --> 00:14:35,400
I must ask Father to reward you
for saving him from losing face

135
00:14:35,800 --> 00:14:37,800
Thank you, Your Highness

136
00:14:37,800 --> 00:14:43,400
Actually, the best reward
is to have you by my side

137
00:14:45,800 --> 00:14:50,400
Your Highness, Marquis,
let me toast you

138
00:14:50,400 --> 00:14:53,400
You must enjoy yourselves tonight!

139
00:14:53,800 --> 00:14:55,400
Thank you!

140
00:15:03,800 --> 00:15:05,800
You must dance!

141
00:15:58,800 --> 00:16:01,800
Isn't this Master Wei?
Top Scholar Wei!

142
00:16:02,800 --> 00:16:04,800
Loitering by yourself in the streets?

143
00:16:05,800 --> 00:16:08,400
Did you make it in the exam?

144
00:16:08,800 --> 00:16:11,400
May I ask if I did?

145
00:16:11,800 --> 00:16:13,800
What do you want to be?

146
00:16:13,800 --> 00:16:16,800
The top scholar.
You just called me Top Scholar

147
00:16:16,800 --> 00:16:20,400
Are you getting senile, Father?

148
00:16:20,800 --> 00:16:24,800
The top scholar is my cousin,
Huang Xinxin

149
00:16:24,800 --> 00:16:27,800
We're on our way to congratulate him

150
00:16:27,800 --> 00:16:28,800
That's right

151
00:16:28,800 --> 00:16:31,800
Let's get going.
It's going to snow soon

152
00:16:31,800 --> 00:16:34,400
Sure, let's go...

153
00:16:34,400 --> 00:16:37,400
You want to be the top scholar?
Dream on!

154
00:16:57,800 --> 00:17:02,400
Heaven, why are you so unfair?

155
00:17:02,800 --> 00:17:09,800
Why do you give me knowledge
but not an official position?

156
00:17:11,400 --> 00:17:12,400
Why?

157
00:17:14,800 --> 00:17:20,400
Why did you let me cross Her Highness'
path but wouldn't let me marry her?

158
00:17:20,800 --> 00:17:27,400
Why are you so cruel as to let those
who look down on me jeer at me?

159
00:17:27,800 --> 00:17:30,400
Why did you make me lose face?

160
00:17:32,800 --> 00:17:36,400
Why do you have to
snow so heavily today?

161
00:17:36,400 --> 00:17:41,400
Why must you make me so upset
and depressed...?

162
00:18:12,800 --> 00:18:13,800
Poor thing

163
00:18:13,800 --> 00:18:17,800
He shouldn't have sat the exam
if he doesn't have what it takes

164
00:18:17,800 --> 00:18:21,800
After failing the exam, he turns into
a beggar! What a disgrace!

165
00:18:24,800 --> 00:18:27,800
Sir, it says here it's a loan

166
00:18:29,800 --> 00:18:33,800
When I get home, I'll return the money.
Can you read at all?

167
00:18:35,800 --> 00:18:39,400
How nicely you put it!
Who knows whether you'll return it

168
00:18:39,800 --> 00:18:44,400
I definitely will.
I live in Ping'an Town

169
00:18:44,800 --> 00:18:49,800
My father runs a herbal shop.
And I'm a friend of Her Highness'

170
00:18:49,800 --> 00:18:51,800
What a braggart!

171
00:18:51,800 --> 00:18:55,800
If you knew Her Highness, you
wouldn't be begging for money here

172
00:18:55,800 --> 00:18:57,800
Let's go...

173
00:19:07,800 --> 00:19:08,800
Wait!

174
00:19:11,800 --> 00:19:14,800
-What's the meaning of this?
-I'm giving it to you

175
00:19:19,800 --> 00:19:22,800
This is "give", and this is "throw"!

176
00:19:24,400 --> 00:19:27,400
I'm taking pity on you, you know

177
00:19:27,600 --> 00:19:29,600
All the more I won't take it!

178
00:19:29,800 --> 00:19:32,800
Do you want to
starve yourself to death?

179
00:19:41,800 --> 00:19:43,800
What have I done to offend you,
Your Highness?

180
00:19:44,800 --> 00:19:49,400
I sent for you to play chess with me
the other day. Why didn't you come?

181
00:19:50,400 --> 00:19:54,400
The envoy from Qie'erqi
sought an audience with me

182
00:19:54,400 --> 00:19:56,400
I had to entertain him

183
00:19:56,800 --> 00:19:58,800
Are the envoys
more important than me?

184
00:19:58,800 --> 00:20:02,800
-I don't mean that
-But it's what you think!

185
00:20:02,800 --> 00:20:05,400
You didn't come because
you felt I was unreasonable

186
00:20:05,400 --> 00:20:07,800
I've never thought that way

187
00:20:08,800 --> 00:20:14,800
You promised Father you'd keep me
company but you're not doing that

188
00:20:14,800 --> 00:20:19,400
Take it that it's my fault.
Please accept my apologies

189
00:20:19,800 --> 00:20:22,800
It is your fault!

190
00:20:22,800 --> 00:20:26,800
Yes, you're right.
It is my fault. I deserve death

191
00:20:26,800 --> 00:20:30,800
From today on, I'll stay by your side
round the clock

192
00:20:31,800 --> 00:20:34,400
You sound so unwilling!

193
00:20:35,800 --> 00:20:39,400
Don't you know my feelings for you?

194
00:20:39,800 --> 00:20:42,400
No. You're always bullying me

195
00:20:43,800 --> 00:20:49,800
I swear that my love for you is true.
If I lie, may I be struck by ligh...

196
00:20:49,800 --> 00:20:53,600
Say no more.
I believe you

197
00:20:59,800 --> 00:21:00,800
Your Highness!

198
00:21:03,400 --> 00:21:04,400
Your Highness!

199
00:21:05,800 --> 00:21:06,800
Your Excellency

200
00:21:06,800 --> 00:21:08,800
-Your Highness
-What is it?

201
00:21:10,800 --> 00:21:12,800
You carry on

202
00:21:16,800 --> 00:21:18,800
What's so secretive?

203
00:21:18,800 --> 00:21:23,400
-I ran into Master Wei just now
-How was he?

204
00:21:23,800 --> 00:21:25,800
He was begging in the streets

205
00:21:26,400 --> 00:21:28,400
Are you joking?

206
00:21:28,400 --> 00:21:30,400
He's the one who's joking

207
00:21:30,400 --> 00:21:34,400
He was begging for a loan but when
a man gave him two copper coins,

208
00:21:34,400 --> 00:21:36,400
he returned them

209
00:21:36,400 --> 00:21:38,400
I don't know what he's up to

210
00:21:39,800 --> 00:21:43,800
Didn't I give him a gold foil fan?
Where is he now?

211
00:21:43,800 --> 00:21:47,800
He should still be in the streets.
Are you going to call on him?

212
00:22:15,800 --> 00:22:18,800
-I don't want it
-You must eat the drumstick

213
00:22:18,800 --> 00:22:22,400
I'll go and buy some fabrics.
Wait here

214
00:22:22,400 --> 00:22:24,400
I just don't want it!

215
00:22:28,800 --> 00:22:32,400
Don't you want this?
What a waste

216
00:22:32,400 --> 00:22:35,400
-It tastes awful
-Not at all

217
00:22:35,800 --> 00:22:38,600
-Have a bite
-No. It tastes awful

218
00:22:38,600 --> 00:22:40,600
I'll prove you wrong

219
00:22:46,800 --> 00:22:49,800
-It's nice. Want some?
-No

220
00:22:49,800 --> 00:22:54,400
What do you think you're doing?
Fancy you stealing food from a boy!

221
00:22:56,800 --> 00:22:58,800
-You've got it wrong...
-Indeed!

222
00:22:58,800 --> 00:23:02,400
Aren't you shameless
to steal food from a boy!

223
00:23:02,400 --> 00:23:04,400
Let's go home!

224
00:23:07,800 --> 00:23:10,400
Master Wei!

225
00:23:36,800 --> 00:23:38,800
I'm not Master Wei

226
00:23:52,800 --> 00:23:54,800
What rotten luck

227
00:23:56,400 --> 00:24:02,400
I only stole some food and Her Highness
had to see it. What a disgrace

228
00:24:03,800 --> 00:24:05,800
How am I to explain it to her?

229
00:24:09,800 --> 00:24:11,400
Master Wei!

230
00:24:13,600 --> 00:24:14,800
Don't run away anymore

231
00:24:21,800 --> 00:24:23,800
My surname isn't Wei

232
00:24:24,800 --> 00:24:32,400
I'm just a good-for-nothing who failed
his exam and has no money for food!

233
00:24:32,800 --> 00:24:34,800
Don't say that of yourself

234
00:24:35,800 --> 00:24:40,400
Don't talk to me or you'll be
looked down upon too. Go away!

235
00:24:41,800 --> 00:24:45,800
I won't bother about what other people
say. All I know is that you're a friend

236
00:24:45,800 --> 00:24:51,800
Had it not been for you,
I'd have died in the desert

237
00:25:00,800 --> 00:25:04,800
Who was the one who taught me to
face up to a problem and that...

238
00:25:04,800 --> 00:25:07,400
miracles would happen
if we persisted?

239
00:25:10,400 --> 00:25:14,400
You helped me
when I was in trouble

240
00:25:14,800 --> 00:25:17,800
So why won't you let me help you now?

241
00:25:19,800 --> 00:25:21,800
Don't you regard me as a friend?

242
00:25:24,800 --> 00:25:25,800
I do

243
00:25:26,800 --> 00:25:33,400
Don't reject my help then.
Let me take you somewhere to eat

244
00:25:36,800 --> 00:25:40,400
I'm not hungry.
I just ate

245
00:25:41,800 --> 00:25:43,800
Take it that you're accompanying me

246
00:26:13,800 --> 00:26:17,800
Buns are good...

247
00:26:18,800 --> 00:26:21,400
I know you don't want me to
spend too much money

248
00:26:21,800 --> 00:26:27,400
But aren't you afraid your stomach might
burst, having eaten so many buns?

249
00:26:27,800 --> 00:26:32,800
Buns are quite filling.
I won't go hungry so soon

250
00:26:34,800 --> 00:26:40,400
I won't have to...
worry about my next meal

251
00:26:41,800 --> 00:26:47,400
Didn't I pass you a gold foil fan? If you
sell it, you'll have money to go home

252
00:26:53,800 --> 00:26:56,800
I haven't sold it,

253
00:26:56,800 --> 00:27:01,400
for I know it represents
your concern for me

254
00:27:01,800 --> 00:27:08,400
My purpose in giving it to you
is for you to sell it for money

255
00:27:09,800 --> 00:27:10,800
Surely not?

256
00:27:11,800 --> 00:27:16,800
I know through this fan,
you're trying to tell me...

257
00:27:17,400 --> 00:27:21,400
our love is steady as gold
and we'll never break up

258
00:27:21,800 --> 00:27:24,800
Our love is steady as gold
and we'll never break up?

259
00:27:26,800 --> 00:27:28,800
You've got it wrong

260
00:27:28,800 --> 00:27:31,800
I've got it wrong?
What do you mean?

261
00:27:32,800 --> 00:27:33,800
Your Highness!

262
00:27:34,800 --> 00:27:37,800
-So here you are, Your Highness
-What is it?

263
00:27:37,800 --> 00:27:41,800
His Majesty has fallen ill.
Return to the Palace quickly

264
00:27:41,800 --> 00:27:44,800
-What happened?
-I have no idea. Get going

265
00:27:46,800 --> 00:27:48,800
Leave everything to me

266
00:27:48,800 --> 00:27:50,800
Get ready the sedan!

267
00:27:53,800 --> 00:27:55,800
Your Highness!

268
00:27:55,800 --> 00:27:58,800
We meet again, Master Wei!

269
00:28:00,800 --> 00:28:04,800
What's the matter?
Feel like throwing up? Go ahead

270
00:28:06,800 --> 00:28:10,400
You shouldn't have gorged yourself

271
00:28:10,800 --> 00:28:14,800
Come, sit down...

272
00:28:18,800 --> 00:28:24,800
You're a friend of Princess Ruining's.
That makes you a friend of mine too

273
00:28:24,800 --> 00:28:29,400
Feel free to order any food.
Don't stand on ceremony

274
00:28:29,600 --> 00:28:31,600
Thanks.
I'm full

275
00:28:31,800 --> 00:28:34,400
Surely not?

276
00:28:36,800 --> 00:28:39,800
You don't get free meals every time

277
00:28:39,800 --> 00:28:43,800
Eat more.
It doesn't feel nice at all to starve

278
00:28:44,800 --> 00:28:46,800
Don't trouble yourself

279
00:28:48,800 --> 00:28:54,400
I almost forgot. Princess Ruining
and I are in love with each other

280
00:28:54,800 --> 00:28:56,800
We'll be tying the knot soon

281
00:28:56,800 --> 00:28:58,800
I don't believe you

282
00:29:00,800 --> 00:29:02,800
If Her Highness fancied you,

283
00:29:02,800 --> 00:29:07,800
she wouldn't have sought our help
when you forced her to marry you

284
00:29:08,400 --> 00:29:10,400
-Was that what she told you?
-Yes!

285
00:29:11,800 --> 00:29:16,800
Wasn't she playful. How could she
lie to you about such matters?

286
00:29:16,800 --> 00:29:18,800
She'd never lie to me!

287
00:29:18,800 --> 00:29:24,400
You see, we had a bet that day.
If I lost, I'd be at her disposal

288
00:29:24,400 --> 00:29:28,400
She and I were just flirting with
each other. Why take it so seriously?

289
00:29:31,800 --> 00:29:36,800
You don't believe me? Go and ask
Her Highness or Hongying then

290
00:29:38,800 --> 00:29:43,400
Two people must be well-matched
in social status in a relationship

291
00:29:43,800 --> 00:29:47,400
You should know where you stand

292
00:29:47,800 --> 00:29:49,800
Look at you...

293
00:29:51,800 --> 00:29:56,400
I'll make a move first.
Enjoy your food

294
00:30:00,600 --> 00:30:02,600
Why is everyone leaving?

295
00:30:05,800 --> 00:30:10,800
I told you not to do it. You've ruined
the otherwise clean and white wall

296
00:30:13,400 --> 00:30:15,800
Had I topped the exam,

297
00:30:16,800 --> 00:30:22,800
you'd have regretted that
I didn't write more words on the wall

298
00:30:22,800 --> 00:30:25,800
Every candidate who stays here
says that

299
00:30:25,800 --> 00:30:28,800
And every time,
I have to clean the wall for them

300
00:30:28,800 --> 00:30:31,800
You people keep bringing trouble
upon yourselves

301
00:30:34,800 --> 00:30:37,400
A tiger on level ground
may be bullied by a dog

302
00:30:42,800 --> 00:30:47,800
Never did I think that
I'd be put down wherever I go

303
00:30:48,800 --> 00:30:50,800
Having come to this stage...

304
00:30:54,800 --> 00:30:57,800
I see no point in my living on

305
00:31:01,800 --> 00:31:03,800
Wait, Reverend!

306
00:31:03,800 --> 00:31:05,800
What is it?

307
00:31:06,800 --> 00:31:12,800
Please take me in as a disciple.
I'd like to take the tonsure

308
00:31:13,800 --> 00:31:16,800
Please get up

309
00:31:17,800 --> 00:31:22,400
If you're void of all feelings,
you won't feel any more pain

310
00:31:23,800 --> 00:31:27,800
The purpose of entering the monkhood
is not to run away from your problems

311
00:31:27,800 --> 00:31:31,800
But I no longer feel attached
to the secular world

312
00:31:32,800 --> 00:31:36,800
You can live the life of a recluse
wherever you are

313
00:31:36,800 --> 00:31:41,800
So why should you insist on
taking the tonsure?

314
00:31:42,800 --> 00:31:49,400
My mind is a whirl.
I have no energy to argue with you

315
00:31:50,800 --> 00:31:55,600
Please let me take the tonsure!

316
00:31:55,600 --> 00:31:58,800
-Please get up first!
-No!

317
00:31:59,800 --> 00:32:03,800
If you don't oblige me,
I'll remain on my knees forever

318
00:32:03,800 --> 00:32:06,800
There are things in life
which cannot be forced

319
00:32:06,800 --> 00:32:10,800
If you insist on kneeling here,
there's nothing I can do

320
00:32:10,800 --> 00:32:14,400
I have to go for my practice.
Please excuse me

321
00:32:15,800 --> 00:32:18,400
Wait, Reverend!

322
00:32:19,600 --> 00:32:21,600
Don't go away, Reverend!

323
00:32:23,800 --> 00:32:24,800
Why?

324
00:32:26,800 --> 00:32:27,800
Why?

325
00:32:30,800 --> 00:32:33,800
Even Buddha has abandoned me

326
00:32:38,600 --> 00:32:40,600
What other way out
is there left for me?

327
00:32:58,800 --> 00:33:02,800
I, Wei Delu, have let Heaven down

328
00:33:04,400 --> 00:33:06,400
I've let the Earth down

329
00:33:08,800 --> 00:33:10,800
I've also let my father down

330
00:33:13,800 --> 00:33:19,600
Father, I really don't have
the courage to go on living anymore

331
00:33:23,800 --> 00:33:29,800
If you don't mind, I'd like to be
your son again in my next life

332
00:33:32,680 --> 00:33:33,800
Father...

333
00:33:36,800 --> 00:33:38,400
Farewell

334
00:33:54,400 --> 00:34:00,400
Father, I really don't have
the courage to go on living anymore

335
00:34:03,800 --> 00:34:09,800
If you don't mind, I'd like to be
your son again in my next life

336
00:34:13,400 --> 00:34:14,400
Father...

337
00:34:16,800 --> 00:34:18,800
Farewell

338
00:34:24,800 --> 00:34:27,400
Your Highness...

339
00:34:38,800 --> 00:34:40,600
Goodbye forever!

340
00:35:02,600 --> 00:35:05,600
Your Highness...

341
00:35:06,800 --> 00:35:09,800
Why did you save my life?

342
00:35:12,800 --> 00:35:15,400
What can I do for you?

343
00:35:15,400 --> 00:35:19,400
Have you seen Master Wei?
We heard he once put up here

344
00:35:19,800 --> 00:35:25,800
He was here a moment ago,
asking me to confer the tonsure on him

345
00:35:25,800 --> 00:35:27,800
He wants to become a monk?

346
00:35:28,400 --> 00:35:33,800
It's like that every year when
the exam results are released

347
00:35:33,800 --> 00:35:39,400
Unsuccessful candidates always feel
ashamed and lose confidence in themselves

348
00:35:40,800 --> 00:35:45,800
A monastery is a place of salvation,
not a refuge

349
00:35:45,800 --> 00:35:48,800
The common people
just don't understand

350
00:35:50,800 --> 00:35:53,800
So do you know where he is?

351
00:35:54,800 --> 00:35:57,400
Still in his room, I should think

352
00:36:21,400 --> 00:36:24,800
That's about it.
I have no more worries

353
00:36:28,800 --> 00:36:33,400
Come to think of it, I only have
two friends in all my life -

354
00:36:33,800 --> 00:36:36,600
Wu Fuqi and Mei Shouquan

355
00:36:37,800 --> 00:36:39,800
They're my bosom friends

356
00:36:41,800 --> 00:36:46,400
Other than them,
my entire life is a blank

357
00:36:47,800 --> 00:36:50,400
-What are you doing?!
-Get away!

358
00:36:51,800 --> 00:36:54,800
Are you out of your mind?
Get down now!

359
00:36:54,800 --> 00:36:58,800
Give me a hand, quick!
Don't just stand there!

360
00:37:00,800 --> 00:37:01,800
Get away!

361
00:37:01,800 --> 00:37:06,400
Come over to help me!
Ignore what he said!

362
00:37:06,800 --> 00:37:08,400
Get away!

363
00:37:13,800 --> 00:37:15,800
Why did you attempt suicide?!

364
00:37:15,800 --> 00:37:19,800
You only failed your exam!
Did you have to kill yourself?!

365
00:37:19,800 --> 00:37:23,800
Had you died, you'd have
let your father, Fu and me down!

366
00:37:23,800 --> 00:37:25,800
You must have been crazy
to think of suicide!

367
00:37:26,800 --> 00:37:28,800
What's the matter with her?

368
00:37:29,800 --> 00:37:32,800
What are you doing?
Help me get him up

369
00:37:37,800 --> 00:37:40,800
You're a man!
Fancy you attempting suicide!

370
00:37:40,800 --> 00:37:45,800
You have no regard for your father,
the Princess and your friends at all!

371
00:37:45,800 --> 00:37:49,800
No...! He's lost all hope in life
yet you still want to beat him

372
00:37:49,800 --> 00:37:52,800
Things are bad enough for him.
Do help him

373
00:38:06,800 --> 00:38:09,800
Why do you eat only vegetables?

374
00:38:11,800 --> 00:38:14,400
Don't tell me you really
want to be a monk?

375
00:38:16,800 --> 00:38:18,800
Say something!

376
00:38:21,800 --> 00:38:28,600
Success and failure
are common in life, Lu

377
00:38:28,800 --> 00:38:32,800
The important thing is to get back
on your feet after a setback

378
00:38:32,800 --> 00:38:38,400
It's a shame if you can't do that!

379
00:38:39,800 --> 00:38:43,800
Don't disturb me while I'm eating!

380
00:38:45,800 --> 00:38:50,800
You only eat and sleep!
You're no different from a pig!

381
00:38:52,800 --> 00:38:55,400
You're wrong.
I'm not a pig

382
00:38:58,800 --> 00:39:01,800
I'm worse than a pig

383
00:39:05,800 --> 00:39:11,800
How could you say that? Where have
all your lofty aspirations gone?

384
00:39:13,800 --> 00:39:20,800
The arrogant Wei Delu who
thinks highly of himself is dead!

385
00:39:23,800 --> 00:39:27,400
-Waiter, some more wine please!
-Coming right up!

386
00:39:40,800 --> 00:39:43,800
Heaven is really unfair to me

387
00:39:45,800 --> 00:39:51,800
I studied hard,
yet I was unsuccessful in my exam

388
00:39:52,800 --> 00:39:56,800
Do you understand my agony?

389
00:39:56,800 --> 00:40:01,800
Of course I do.
I'm your bosom friend

390
00:40:01,800 --> 00:40:05,800
What I don't understand is,
how could you have failed the exam?

391
00:40:07,800 --> 00:40:13,400
How would I know? The title for this year
was, Food is the First Necessity of Man

392
00:40:13,800 --> 00:40:16,600
This was what I wrote

393
00:40:17,800 --> 00:40:23,400
Ping'an is a big town in Luzhou.
It had no strange phenomena for a century

394
00:40:23,800 --> 00:40:29,400
The people there
lived in peace and prosperity

395
00:40:29,800 --> 00:40:33,800
But one day, disaster struck

396
00:40:35,800 --> 00:40:43,600
A boy who lived in the east
of the town fell sick

397
00:40:43,800 --> 00:40:49,800
His parents took him to many doctors,
but he still died

398
00:40:51,400 --> 00:40:55,800
After that, the disease
spread to the west of the town

399
00:40:55,800 --> 00:40:59,800
Members of five families
died one after another

400
00:41:01,800 --> 00:41:03,800
There was chaos in Ping'an Town

401
00:41:05,800 --> 00:41:10,400
The saint says, "Cultivate yourself, put
your family in order and run the state"

402
00:41:10,800 --> 00:41:15,800
During the epidemic, my father stocked up
food and marked up the prices of rice

403
00:41:15,800 --> 00:41:19,400
That was a wicked thing to do

404
00:41:19,400 --> 00:41:25,400
I read books written by saints. So I
couldn't possibly sit back and do nothing

405
00:41:27,400 --> 00:41:30,800
So I argued with my father

406
00:41:30,800 --> 00:41:35,800
He finally realized his mistake
and distributed the food to the needy

407
00:41:35,800 --> 00:41:39,400
I was only following
the saints' teachings

408
00:41:40,400 --> 00:41:42,800
Well said!

409
00:41:46,400 --> 00:41:48,800
It was an excellent essay!

410
00:41:56,800 --> 00:42:00,800
You know what? I analyzed all the things
that happened in Ping'an Town...

411
00:42:00,800 --> 00:42:03,800
during the epidemic

412
00:42:03,800 --> 00:42:05,800
I even criticized my father!

413
00:42:06,400 --> 00:42:10,400
There were tears and blood
in my essay!

414
00:42:10,800 --> 00:42:17,400
Indeed there were. How could such an
excellent essay not been selected?

415
00:42:17,400 --> 00:42:19,400
What exactly went wrong?

416
00:42:19,800 --> 00:42:23,400
What went wrong?

417
00:42:24,800 --> 00:42:27,400
Could it have had
to do with the examiner?

418
00:42:29,400 --> 00:42:34,400
Even if it concerned the examiner,
what could you do?

419
00:42:34,800 --> 00:42:36,800
It's all too late now

420
00:42:38,800 --> 00:42:41,800
Haven't you heard?
Better late than never

421
00:42:41,800 --> 00:42:46,800
What can be done?
Can you do anything at all?

422
00:42:46,800 --> 00:42:48,800
Not me, of course

423
00:42:48,800 --> 00:42:53,800
Don't you remember your sweetheart,
Princess Ruining?

424
00:42:56,800 --> 00:43:01,400
For goodness' sake, don't mention her.
It makes my heart ache!

425
00:43:01,800 --> 00:43:06,800
Stop pretending. Rewrite your essay
and I'll hand it to her for you

426
00:43:06,800 --> 00:43:07,800
No!

427
00:43:08,800 --> 00:43:10,800
It's a torture rewriting it

428
00:43:11,400 --> 00:43:15,400
Would you rather suffer just once or
live with it for the rest of your life?

429
00:43:15,400 --> 00:43:17,400
Just let me be!
I won't write it and that's that!

430
00:43:17,800 --> 00:43:20,800
-You really won't write it?
-No!

431
00:43:20,800 --> 00:43:25,800
Very well!
Princess Ruining...!

432
00:43:25,800 --> 00:43:33,800
Princess Ruining...
Princess Ruining...

433
00:43:35,800 --> 00:43:37,800
Bring me a brush!

434
00:43:38,800 --> 00:43:43,800
That's better! Rewrite it and I'll
take it to Her Highness. She'll help you

435
00:43:43,800 --> 00:43:47,400
Given your talent,
you couldn't have failed the exam

436
00:43:49,800 --> 00:43:51,800
Are you so confident of me?

437
00:43:54,400 --> 00:43:59,400
We're buddies. I must say
you like to shoot your mouth off

438
00:43:59,800 --> 00:44:01,800
But you have great knowledge

439
00:44:01,800 --> 00:44:05,800
If you don't become an official, it'll
be the loss of our country and our town

440
00:44:05,800 --> 00:44:06,800
Agreed?

441
00:44:17,800 --> 00:44:19,600
Father!

442
00:44:26,400 --> 00:44:28,400
What's wrong with my father?

443
00:44:28,400 --> 00:44:30,800
I need a word with you, Your Highness

444
00:44:40,800 --> 00:44:42,800
Subtitled by S Lin


